uot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">서울과 함께(에라토스테네스의 지구크기 측정) &#8226; 수업 잘하는 교사 이강토</p><p class=\"og-desc\"> </p><p class=\"og-host\">earth.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">함께 하실 수 있습니다, 선생님들</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">자세한 내용은 아래 링크 글입니다.</span></b><br><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=fLMH&amp;datanum=2\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fLMH/2\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">댓글을 작성하시면 저와 함께 시작! 입니다</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">위 글을 읽고 몰래 혼자 하셔도 됩니다</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">저는 위 일정대로 실험을 계속합니다.</span></b><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
